flowchart TD
    A[Student Submits Event] --> B[Fetch Category Config]
    B --> C{Category Found?}
    C -->|No| D[Return 0 Points]
    C -->|Yes| E[Initialize Total = 0]
    E --> F[For Each Attribute]
    F --> G[Get Attribute Value]
    G --> H{Value in Config?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Add Points to Total]
    H -->|No| F
    I --> F
    F --> J[Calculate Final Points]
    J --> K[Update Event Points]
    K --> L[Update Student Total]
    L --> M[Recalculate Leaderboard]
